  "body": "Follow-up to #41. That PR was already merged before T clarified that \u201cprofiles/procedures\u201d meant repository copies of the specialists\u2019 persona wording.\n\nAdds exactly two KB-owned profile files copied from the live Hermes profiles:\n\n- `KnowledgeBase/BoardGames/operators/bathcat.md`\n- `KnowledgeBase/BoardGames/operators/the-mennonite.md`\n\nEach includes identity, company role, jurisdiction, workflow, KB standing order, voice, danger, and guardrail.\n\nValidation: 2,637 OKFs clean; 44 active intake/provenance tests passed; 1 intentional skip.",
